{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_05_end",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_05",
  "title": "各抒己见",
  "storyCode": "GT-5",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d1f892edb681cfeb0f3301e61ff9f807a7b0fff9d6f9c1593fb7376440ffb775",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "呃......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "你，你这个碍事的混蛋小子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "都、都头破血流成这样了，还敢在这挡我们的好事——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "区区这点伤，连日常训练都算不上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "咕——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "还剩多少人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "算了，记不清了，反正已经全都挡住——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "发、发生地震了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "欸？那边的山岩怎么崩塌了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "骗人的吧？她居然打破了那么厚的石壁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "入口被打开了一条新的路！赶紧进去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "糟了，那些人一定会从斯卡蒂打出的通道涌进来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "得赶快去帮可——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "站住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "斯卡蒂——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "居然能直接破坏山体，强行穿过去，罗德岛的异闻果然是真的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "那个女孩在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "我不能告诉你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "盯上那东西的人不止我一个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "难道我非要把你好好教训一顿，你才不会碍事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你突然就要带走可萝尔，我怎么也不能轻易把她交给你啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你要......阻碍罗德岛的任务？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你也没告诉我罗德岛给你分配了什么任务啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "除非你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "不要突然攻击同伴啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "谁是你的同伴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我最后一次问，带我去见那个女孩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "只要她还是我的委托人，我就绝不会这么做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "呜呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "可恶，她只是用剑随手碰了下我的枪而已啊，可我的胳膊好像要断了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "只凭你这种能力，你真的认为自己保护得了她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "能不能做到，和去不去做是两回事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "嗯？先等等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "嘁，这下总该打中了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "text": "好像有，不对，好像没有！那家伙还好好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......又来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "呃......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "text": "灾、灾星！把上尉打伤的，就是你吧！你今天就别想从这里——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "好机会，趁现在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "你也别想过去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你们还是想想办法先拦住她吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "——咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "什么情况？！那个小个子，从我们头上跳过去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "斯卡蒂，我先走一步了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "不好意思！等你想清楚，准备告诉我事实了，我再考虑可萝尔的事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "站住，你去哪里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "抱歉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "text": "你怎么就放她走了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "她跑得太快了，我们追不上她啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "text": "没事，这不是还有一个吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "text": "你个子那么大，不可能也跳过去吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你们完蛋了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "岔路好多啊。这里就是可萝尔所说的墓穴了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "呃，赏金猎人——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "咕......救命......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "太惨了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "就像是被罗德岛号来回碾压过好几遍......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "可、可斯卡蒂不是还没进来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "这个看上去像炸开的洞是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "也就是说——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你已经想明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我哪里演得不好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你果然是————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
